%h1 Regions

%p
  Switching off a region will disable the box/IDE functionality for all boxes in that region.

%p
  You can use `Broadcast Message` to send a notification to currently active users of a region, before switching off that region.

%table.table
  %thead
    %tr
      %th name
      %th
  %tbody

    - @regions.each do |region|
      %tr
        %td
          = region.name
          - unless region.enabled?
            %span (Disabled)
        %td
          - if region.up?
            = link_to 'Send Warning Message', start_to_go_down_admin_region_url(region), method: :put, class: 'btn btn-warning'
            = link_to 'Disable Box Creation', disable_box_creation_admin_region_url(region), method: :put, class: 'btn btn-danger'
          - elsif region.box_creation_disabled?
            = link_to 'Enable Box Creation', enable_box_creation_admin_region_url(region), method: :put, class: 'btn btn-success'
          - elsif region.going_down?
            = link_to 'Go Down', go_down_admin_region_url(region), method: :put, class: 'btn btn-danger'
            = link_to 'Go Up',  go_up_admin_region_url(region), method: :put, class: 'btn btn-success'
          - elsif region.down?
            = link_to 'Go Up',  go_up_admin_region_url(region), method: :put, class: 'btn btn-success'

